{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roll the dice, grow the board, beat the clock.\u00a0KOROMEKE has simple rules and combo-rich situations that force you to think on your feet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >KOROMEKE is an incremental roguelike game that is played on a unique looping board. Collect jewels to complete each round and build out a unique board of mind-bending abilities on every run.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beat the game across several difficulties or push yourself to the limit with endless mode.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stay in the zone with thought-provoking and tactical gameplay.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock 50+ abilities and create countless combos.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >KOROMEKE was originally conceived for the GMTK Game Jam 2025.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3946400?t=1755904965","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3946400?t=1755904965","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3946400/626b4f79104494ebf2edf760c16e76e92200ba23/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1755904965","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3946400/626b4f79104494ebf2edf760c16e76e92200ba23/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1755904965","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roll the dice, grow the board, beat the clock.\u00a0KOROMEKE has simple rules and combo-rich situations that force you to think on your feet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >KOROMEKE is an incremental roguelike game that is played on a unique looping 